                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "afb37f64-3e32-34e8-b468-333628f52a07",
                        "entry_id": "f4ded68a-c92e-38aa-a301-60848f01b258",
                        "glosses": [
                            "stack, rick"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9df602ad-4440-462a-989d-84dd06d39cb7",
                                "sense_id": "afb37f64-3e32-34e8-b468-333628f52a07",
                                "text": "Когда́ прихо́дит вре́мя плати́ть проце́нты и́ли высыла́ть жене́ де́ньги, он про́сит у всех взаймы́ с таки́м выраже́нием, как бу́дто у него́ до́ма пожа́р, и в э́то вре́мя, очертя́ го́лову, продаёт он весь свой зи́мний запа́с хво́роста за пять рубле́й, скирду́ соло́мы за три рубля́ и пото́м вели́т топи́ть свои́ пе́чи садо́вою решёткой и́ли ста́рыми парнико́выми ра́мами.",
                                "translation": "When the time came to pay the interest on the mortgage or to send money to his wife, he asked every one to lend him money with as much agitation as though his house were on fire, and, at the same time losing his head, he would sell the whole of his winter store of fuel for five roubles and a stack of straw for three roubles, and then have his garden fence or old cucumber-frames chopped up to heat his stoves.",
                                "english": "When the time came to pay the interest on the mortgage or to send money to his wife, he asked every one to lend him money with as much agitation as though his house were on fire, and, at the same time losing his head, he would sell the whole of his winter store of fuel for five roubles and a stack of straw for three roubles, and then have his garden fence or old cucumber-frames chopped up to heat his stoves."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
